<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO DRAIN PLN ONE BLN FOR ONE, FIVE DAYS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO DRAIN PLN ONE BLN FOR ONE, FIVE DAYS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to drain one billion zlotys, in nominal terms, off the</p>
<p>market for one and five days through a reverse NBP-bill</p>
<p>repurchase auction, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Dec 18, 1996</p>
<p>    Repurchase		    - Dec 19, 1996, Dec 23, 1996</p>
<p>    Discount rate (pct)	 - 20.00</p>
<p>    Maturity of bills offered - Jan 15, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
